# A tetrahedron with uvs and normals: exercises the v/vt/vn triple, shared
# positions with differing normals, and a quad face for fan triangulation.
v 0.0 1.0 0.0
v -1.0 -1.0 1.0
v 1.0 -1.0 1.0
v 0.0 -1.0 -1.0
vt 0.5 1.0
vt 0.0 0.0
vt 1.0 0.0
vn 0.0 0.5 0.9
vn 0.8 0.5 -0.3
vn -0.8 0.5 -0.3
vn 0.0 -1.0 0.0
f 1/1/1 2/2/1 3/3/1
f 1/1/2 3/2/2 4/3/2
f 1/1/3 4/2/3 2/3/3
f 2/1/4 4/2/4 3/3/4
